    "long_instructions": "#AI in Creative Writing\r\n\r\n**Inquiry Question**: How can I use AI to expand my own imagination?\r\n\r\n####Color-Coding Key\r\n\r\n**Green** - Fully human-created writing\r\n\r\n**Blue** - Mix of human / AI writing\r\n\r\n**Red** - Completely AI-generated writing\r\n",
